1️⃣ Splash Screen

    Purpose: Branding + initial animation.

    Content:

        Animated logo and app name.

        Navigate to HomePage after 4–5 seconds.

    Widgets/Features:

        AnimatedBuilder + Transform for floating logo.

        Gradient background.

----------------------------------------------------------------------------

2️⃣ Home Page / Lobby Entry

    Purpose: Start or join a multiplayer auction.

    Content:

        Buttons:

        Create Room → generates new auction room in Firebase.

        Join Room → input room code to join.

        List of available rooms (optional).

    Widgets/Features:

        TextField for room code input.

        ListView for showing current rooms.

        Navigate to Lobby Page.

----------------------------------------------------------------------------

3️⃣ Lobby Page

    Purpose: Wait for all players to join.

    Content:

        Show connected players (from Firebase).

        “Ready” button to start auction.

    Widgets/Features:

        StreamBuilder to listen to rooms/{roomId}/players.

        Highlight ready/not-ready status.

        Start button triggers auction → navigate to Auction Page.

----------------------------------------------------------------------------

4️⃣ Team Selection Page (Optional)

    Purpose: Choose IPL team before auction.

    Content:

        Grid of IPL teams with logos.

        Highlight selected team.

        Confirm button.

    Widgets/Features:

        GridView.builder for teams.

        Store selection in Firebase: rooms/{roomId}/players/{userId}/team.

----------------------------------------------------------------------------

5️⃣ Auction Page

    Purpose: Real-time bidding for players.

    Content:

        Current player card (photo + stats).

        Highest bid and bidder info.

        Bid buttons (+10, +50, or input).

        Countdown timer for current auction.

        User team budget bar.

    Widgets/Features:

        StreamBuilder on rooms/{roomId}/highestBid.

        Bid actions update Firebase.

        Timer synced via DB (endTime).

        On auction end → assign player to winning bidder → update team in DB.

----------------------------------------------------------------------------

6️⃣ Team Overview Page

    Purpose: Show each user’s team after each round.

    Content:

        List/Grid of players assigned to team.

        Budget remaining.

        Stats summary.

    Widgets/Features:

        StreamBuilder on rooms/{roomId}/teams/{userId}.

        Continue button → next auction round.

----------------------------------------------------------------------------

8️⃣ Result / Summary Page

    Purpose: Show final auction results.

    Content:

        Full team list for all players.

        Stats / leaderboard.

        Restart auction or exit button.

    Widgets/Features:

        Grid/List of teams & players.

        Navigate back to HomePage to start new game.





